flowchart TD
    A([Buyer]) -->|Checkout| B[Order Created\nin Database]
    B --> C{Payment\nGateway}

    C -->|Midtrans IDR| D[Midtrans Snap\nPayment]
    C -->|CoinPayments Crypto| E[CoinPayments\nInvoice]

    D -->|Webhook Callback| F{Payment\nSuccessful?}
    E -->|IPN Callback| F

    F -->|No| G([Order Failed\n/ Pending])
    F -->|Yes| H[Update Order\nto Paid]

    H --> I[Reduce Stock\nin Database]
    I --> J[Generate\nkeccak256 Fingerprint\nof Order Data]

    J --> K[Sign & Broadcast\nEIP-1559 Tx\nvia Base RPC]
    K --> L[(OrderRegistry\nSmart Contract\non Base)]

    L --> M[anchor called:\nstore dataHash\n+ orderId + timestamp]
    M --> N[Blockchain\nTx Hash stored\nin DB]

    N --> O([Public Transparency\nPage with\nOn-chain Proof])
    O --> P{Verify\nOrder?}
    P -->|Yes| Q[Recompute\nFingerprint]
    Q --> R[Call recordOf\non Contract]
    R --> S{Hash\nMatches?}
    S -->|Yes| T([Verified ✓])
    S -->|No| U([Tampered ✗])

    style L fill:#4f46e5,color:#fff,stroke:#4338ca
    style T fill:#16a34a,color:#fff,stroke:#15803d
    style U fill:#dc2626,color:#fff,stroke:#b91c1c
    style J fill:#0891b2,color:#fff,stroke:#0e7490
    style M fill:#4f46e5,color:#fff,stroke:#4338ca
